  <summary>&lt;p>Sweet Ambar Blue Plasma Theme&lt;br />&lt;br />For better looking please use this theme with  &lt;a href="https://github.com/tsujan/Kvantum/tree/master/Kvantum">Kvantum&lt;/a> engine, you can find the official installation instructions &lt;a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tsujan/Kvantum/master/Kvantum/INSTALL">here&lt;/a>.&lt;br />&lt;br />Suggested setings: &lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1294013/">Sweet-Ambar-Blue Kvantum theme&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1897308/">Sweet-Ambar-blue Aurorae theme &lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1897307/">Sweet-Ambar-Blue colorscheme&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1297008/">Sweet-Ambar-Blue Konsole color scheme &lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://www.pling.com/p/1305251/">Candy icons&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://www.pling.com/p/1309907/">Sweet wallpaper&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1334945/"> Sweet sddm theme &lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://dribbble.com/shots/3373125-Hexagonal-planets-and-cosmic-dust?utm_source=Pinterest_Shot"> Wallpaper in screenshot here&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;b>- Note -&lt;/b>&lt;br />&lt;br />Firefox: if you are a firefox user, you can give a chance to the &lt;a href="https://addons.mozilla.org/es/firefox/addon/sweet-dark/">sweet-dark&lt;/a> extension for a better looking or try my complete &lt;a href="https://github.com/EliverLara/firefox-sweet-theme">&lt;b>Firefox-Sweet-Theme&lt;/b> &lt;/a>.&lt;/p></summary>
